"P2088667522" "The time has come. Recluse made his assault on Siren's Call. From there he will sweep across Paragon and then the world. If my hypothesis is true, then he will succeed and in his success, he will actually save the world from annihilation."
// AcceptString :
"P1973674650" "Assault Siren's Call"
// SendOffString :
